Project 4: Terraform CI/CD
Implement GitHub Actions, OIDC, automatic plans, security scans and reviewed deployments.
Skills: GitHub Actions, OIDC, plan approval, DevSecOps

Project 5: Kubernetes Infrastructure with Terraform
Provision an AWS EKS cluster, networking, node groups and IAM integrations using maintained Terraform modules.
Skills: EKS, IAM, Kubernetes, networking, modules

